----------------------------------------------------------------------
Game Copyright Notice (Hard Truck Apocalypse series)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent, fan-made Chinese localization ("translation
patch") plus engine-compatibility fixes for the Hard Truck Apocalypse /
Ex Machina video game series (including the "Rise of Clans" / "Tribe Rising"
expansion). It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the
copyright holders of those games.

Hard Truck Apocalypse and all related titles, characters, artwork, music, and
trademarks are the property of their respective copyright holders, including
but not limited to:

    - Targem Games (original developer)
    - Nival Interactive (EU publisher)
    - CDV Software (NA publisher)
    - Buka Entertainment (worldwide publisher on Steam)

Copyright (c) their respective owners. All rights reserved.

This project distributes NO copyrighted game assets. It provides only
translation text, font atlases, and runtime compatibility patches that users
must apply to their own legally acquired copies of the games. The games
themselves are not redistributed by this project and remain governed by their
own licenses and copyright. None of the patches modify the game executables;
they are all applied at runtime.

